on panel (101) modulates light from each of the EL elements (100R, 100G, 100B) to form color images.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Source plate de lumière, comportant un ensemble périodique d'éléments électroluminescents rouges, verts et bleus (100R, 100G, 100B) doté d'une structure de résonateur optique sur un substrat (103) en verre, qui est placée à l'arrière d'un panneau de modulation optique (101) ne comportant pas de filtre coloré. Le panneau de modulation optique (101) module la lumière provenant de chacun des éléments électroluminescents (100R, 100G, 100B) pour former des images en couleur.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>